{
  "version": 1,
  "provider": "aliyun-cosyvoice",
  "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash",
  "voices": {
    "alpha": {
      "id": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.95
    },
    "xiaobei": {
      "id": "longanhuan_v3",
      "rate": 1.08
    }
  },
  "clips": {
    "s00-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s00-alpha-01-d80e49706ceba69d.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "我是阿尔法。",
      "hash": "d80e49706ceba69d9a2752604ed9d71f64cc8d3423ffc05dfbe4c700122c671a",
      "duration": 1.546375
    },
    "s00-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s00-alpha-02-8618a81215cfbb87.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "留下你的称呼，我会说明各个模块。",
      "hash": "8618a81215cfbb8756eb8c041ff6b4f844593a74b9dc4eea8b2b82e6f144a35a",
      "duration": 3.525792
    },
    "s00-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s00-xiaobei-01-231b1b1c77e0e07b.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "你好呀，我是小北，在后台帮你们查资料、看结果。",
      "hash": "231b1b1c77e0e07b76ae9a60d4833490ccd9ad5804634744de6b4fe5a5af605f",
      "duration": 4.092583
    },
    "s00-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s00-xiaobei-02-06d11712b5f0d6cf.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "头像和分工以后也能调整。",
      "hash": "06d11712b5f0d6cfa4a985c0785a66a0de7df997fea09bc0e27f632fe61d1d52",
      "duration": 2.574083
    },
    "s01-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s01-alpha-01-91923a6cce84e292.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "我们用一个示例认识这个应用。",
      "hash": "91923a6cce84e2922fc716357bc1655087e110ccb9bed3801f483700e2745213",
      "duration": 3.030917
    },
    "s01-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s01-alpha-02-dcee28cb8263d3bd.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "主页、建模、学习和工具会分别介绍。",
      "hash": "dcee28cb8263d3bd50912a82e6b82326e95e886523fad707f5388fde52d5c715",
      "duration": 4.020625
    },
    "s01-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s01-xiaobei-01-22c2dd6df191149e.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "嗯嗯，我在后台准备了一个救护站选址的例子。",
      "hash": "22c2dd6df191149e47d5bb234c14e102709fd750afdd48cdad8b8b4b0140159a",
      "duration": 3.351833
    },
    "s01-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s01-xiaobei-02-a4de1a0f5f885244.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "导览分成六部分，每讲完一部分都会问你可以随时停下。",
      "hash": "a4de1a0f5f885244264dd30387a03534e82485df524affb9c7d34702709a40f3",
      "duration": 4.166667
    },
    "s01-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s01-xiaobei-03-3a43244354727f9d.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "这次用的是示例数据，不会改动你的项目，当然 也不消耗模型额度哦。",
      "hash": "3a43244354727f9d4637726291ce7412746bafa94d6004a8cc582cbbfad151db",
      "duration": 5.722208
    },
    "s02-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s02-alpha-01-d1b696ab55f4c6f6.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里是项目主页。",
      "hash": "d1b696ab55f4c6f68ea8e1c37fa9902fc589e241ba012bdc468a9c5959684380",
      "duration": 1.793833
    },
    "s02-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s02-alpha-02-17ca2cdbb9d202d6.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "新题目点击“新建项目”，已有项目从记录中打开。",
      "hash": "17ca2cdbb9d202d60f7eaf1ece54cf8113845d505e91bfbf4ce6cd4aa22797e6",
      "duration": 5.257958
    },
    "s02-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s02-alpha-03-cfd2685f709f9cac.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "顶部可以切换不同模块。",
      "hash": "cfd2685f709f9cacb93efa4611fc52e88ac9935480676ea8d79b931b8601e561",
      "duration": 2.7835
    },
    "s02-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s02-xiaobei-01-a6db25f77aa4ca77.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "有题目就从新建项目开始，还没选题的话，去题库里说不定有惊喜。",
      "hash": "a6db25f77aa4ca7715352949b0fccd2e71e4123848a4a4c589aff321b58679ff",
      "duration": 5.129625
    },
    "s02-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s02-xiaobei-02-11ede4665eaa936c.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "遇到不熟悉的方法，学习页面里大概路有答案。",
      "hash": "11ede4665eaa936c4ec20cb3e4bba22f4a844a0b1d5c9961b4c28af7f5666d12",
      "duration": 3.5
    },
    "s02-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s02-xiaobei-03-8c63ee312b6db72c.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "上次做了一半的题目，可以从原项目随时继续，讨论记录都会保存。",
      "hash": "8c63ee312b6db72cedfc5b0e4d1fb9dfbc3aab19916dd520f66c8da249f06e89",
      "duration": 5.092583
    },
    "s03-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s03-alpha-01-001426607f23a43c.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "在这里输入题目，或上传题目文件。",
      "hash": "001426607f23a43ca453006803a5a2f1fdb7e8d367c1dad53597aa007b96ad68",
      "duration": 3.361958
    },
    "s03-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s03-alpha-02-ab81539f74dc7e37.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "下面填写初步想法，暂时没有也能开始。",
      "hash": "ab81539f74dc7e371f936726037e63046d6df60ca9702d8b802bc4a894c8dcf2",
      "duration": 4.103083
    },
    "s03-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s03-xiaobei-01-31788cdf93db6750.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "我们要给两个救护站选位置。",
      "hash": "31788cdf93db675028b98b8a682e85dfdc0ecfcb6c4b7182accd0e8de02ba6ac",
      "duration": 2.314833
    },
    "s03-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s03-xiaobei-02-71cc6ce9cae21bb2.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "我想到的是人口比较多的区域，那里需要服务的人也多。",
      "hash": "71cc6ce9cae21bb2d2cf6755f73b28496e07644af5ac181171ad1f9715a60f44",
      "duration": 3.9815
    },
    "s03-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s03-xiaobei-03-a1da89be0abfc17a.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "不过，距离远的地方能不能及时到达，还得算一算。",
      "hash": "a1da89be0abfc17a245f8f4e58da323550b1bc2498729a71af7e694a8387823e",
      "duration": 3.870375
    },
    "s03-xiaobei-04": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s03-xiaobei-04-05c7586b22517668.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "像这样的初步想法就能写进去，就好了 嘿嘿。",
      "hash": "05c7586b225176689caadd6c7c3c65507b41ebe0ac363b39090dd5879c05ede1",
      "duration": 3.574083
    },
    "s04-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s04-alpha-01-5e27c51549ce728f.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里列出当前题目的建模步骤。",
      "hash": "5e27c51549ce728fb76fd1918104033d720365c50bbbba7c43c3be5d66c08a6b",
      "duration": 2.948458
    },
    "s04-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s04-alpha-02-28960fa29850f2e1.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "包括问题分析、假设、建模、求解和检验。",
      "hash": "28960fa29850f2e1c745f1c355e3e4ca31a0aac5f83b91cf3ac4d5d4b2f4e804",
      "duration": 4.3505
    },
    "s04-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s04-alpha-03-e954d0c173da2b5e.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "需要核对条件时，点击这里查看题面。",
      "hash": "e954d0c173da2b5ef198fc479f6f96c3cd341d020b6774016bbd013346c6f99d",
      "duration": 4.103083
    },
    "s04-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s04-xiaobei-01-5cd5ef92d03ef69d.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "比如现在讨论的是选址条件，就把这一项说清楚，后面的计算有单独的步骤。",
      "hash": "5cd5ef92d03ef69d100ab4a9b8f964d99e4fecc98c342d99382d59bdc15edae1",
      "duration": 5.425958
    },
    "s04-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s04-xiaobei-02-3af1048c81a1cd4a.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "什么 你说八分钟的要求记不清了？真拿你没办法，题面就在旁边，可以随时打开核对。",
      "hash": "3af1048c81a1cd4a00e031a699387634031f4ef6ca6fac74908cce8c0ae81659",
      "duration": 6.462958
    },
    "s05-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s05-alpha-01-46350446ed0a3528.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "在讨论区写下判断、疑问和依据。",
      "hash": "46350446ed0a35282287a9cfca0947e4f6b77816cd15d1d28314d364d9bdbb10",
      "duration": 3.938125
    },
    "s05-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s05-alpha-02-cea8e3695687ca46.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "讨论完成后，可以整理成当前步骤的草稿。",
      "hash": "cea8e3695687ca46d6f6c4820848c1bead92d7ef767d53b823b655faea7de11a",
      "duration": 3.773208
    },
    "s05-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s05-xiaobei-01-437e6da37df2e3c7.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "我想问：只选人口最多的两个区域，合适吗？",
      "hash": "437e6da37df2e3c7e2cbefc58b1f2a2d40042c6306b1621e2385fcb54b4d5772",
      "duration": 3.5
    },
    "s05-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s05-xiaobei-02-37e1e2f5961a2ea3.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "距离远的区域会不会超过八分钟？",
      "hash": "37e1e2f5961a2ea361d52d8f73b82b09f20c331625a6678dea62c96a3226b0c7",
      "duration": 2.796292
    },
    "s05-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s05-xiaobei-03-d5fc17818b767d4d.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "你也可以直接这样问，不用客气，把自己不确定的地方说清楚就行。",
      "hash": "d5fc17818b767d4d374dc48c078cd8098faa19aea01a05034f4290258fd7b4a6",
      "duration": 4.75925
    },
    "s06-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s06-alpha-01-881de720d226fff9.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "“计算与验证”用于检查当前方案。",
      "hash": "881de720d226fff9b788136b5d409f1dfd407d1c2e23be9d8c2b07a34dc12266",
      "duration": 3.690708
    },
    "s06-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s06-alpha-02-c8992c7be87425ca.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里记录计算结果、图表和推导过程，也能补充外部结果。",
      "hash": "c8992c7be87425cade6cbc494f9ba9163981e8f7e23c27b71a95bf5946a71004",
      "duration": 5.835042
    },
    "s06-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s06-xiaobei-01-caf70ef0873709e7.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "你在表格里算过的结果，或者纸上写的推导，都可以补充进来。",
      "hash": "caf70ef0873709e780cf295f2fa696d8f56abc6f00c3798c34c185d1e8f89fae",
      "duration": 4.425917
    },
    "s06-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s06-xiaobei-02-b84f0eafccc8c628.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "哦对，别忘了写用的哪些数据、得到了什么结论，回头检查时用得上。",
      "hash": "b84f0eafccc8c628e2f60f4bce1545e12a982ff0f310e8aa5fcccaa3f3f16c4f",
      "duration": 5.611125
    },
    "s07-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s07-alpha-01-82619448f189ac27.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "需要编程时，在这里编辑并运行代码。",
      "hash": "82619448f189ac2722bf647fd72d4d4044ce6565d7843c0f443ffda40cdc21b8",
      "duration": 4.103083
    },
    "s07-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s07-alpha-02-c72bab3e0abb05fc.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "结果面板和终端可以切换查看，运行中的程序可以停止。",
      "hash": "c72bab3e0abb05fc17eb3ecefe3602731fec7e94bf20dee2780b6d597bb35953",
      "duration": 5.422667
    },
    "s07-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s07-alpha-03-89761666ffe51bc1.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "本次示例只查看已有输出。",
      "hash": "89761666ffe51bc1d04badd563d1593beba248e685508841baf4f4993f3defd2",
      "duration": 2.7835
    },
    "s07-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s07-xiaobei-01-6fe8698c361ce3f4.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "这份示例已经有输出了，导览里不用实际运行。",
      "hash": "6fe8698c361ce3f4943967298d0474f89929e28daaaee106224eaeb7cd2802cd",
      "duration": 3.5
    },
    "s07-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s07-xiaobei-02-ffb3451b99b97db0.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "自己写代码时，报错和运行信息到终端看，生成的结果也会在面板出现哦。",
      "hash": "ffb3451b99b97db0fb9ac137f8b3a949bcbef73c8277759321e347fca8406127",
      "duration": 5.9815
    },
    "s08-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s08-alpha-01-d50ba8d28e9ff645.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "A 加 B 的最长用时是十二分钟，超过八分钟的要求。",
      "hash": "d50ba8d28e9ff645ec27d7e71d59962c3070eb36094814ed8aceffe5b882f7d6",
      "duration": 5.422667
    },
    "s08-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s08-alpha-02-65fa98b65e84ab82.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "A 加 C 的最长用时是七分钟，满足要求。",
      "hash": "65fa98b65e84ab827aece4d0f0631fd45cc6b90b8f305cbe1f7739019d602413",
      "duration": 4.845375
    },
    "s08-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s08-alpha-03-d45c0fdbce0eec08.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "判断方案是否可用，要核对结果与题目条件。",
      "hash": "d45c0fdbce0eec083ef1ba7fc64b682b57111c4d0c3af4a63f2e5ada9c5618bb",
      "duration": 4.268042
    },
    "s08-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s08-xiaobei-01-72b366e4826d0718.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "原来 A 加 B 要十二分钟，比要求多了四分钟。",
      "hash": "72b366e4826d071877d3a7965ff180e7f389399cec4a266edb9cf2d4c66faa6f",
      "duration": 3.685167
    },
    "s08-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s08-xiaobei-02-f74dc06a8f16c986.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "那我刚才只看人口的想法。哎呀，确实漏掉了路程时间。",
      "hash": "f74dc06a8f16c986e522a0fc329c1dc037315ab4c6b08af0b60daae9360a63b9",
      "duration": 4.24075
    },
    "s08-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s08-xiaobei-03-b298e78e9437d730.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "这次比较里，A 加 C 符合条件，这个计算结果也要记下来。",
      "hash": "b298e78e9437d7302c83ec84785534f316422d29d0f4d86c742ab28b8fc4148e",
      "duration": 4.685167
    },
    "s09-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s09-alpha-01-20b70e32b371fd55.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "把选择、理由、数据和限制写清楚。",
      "hash": "20b70e32b371fd55a6c5f769261b898a46c4089363d341827693d2c3bacbaa2c",
      "duration": 4.681958
    },
    "s09-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s09-alpha-02-5294d383e0708695.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "点击确认后，这一步才会成为项目记录。",
      "hash": "5294d383e0708695d92e251e8bc5c6b2aae7bce12c38e85a3fc0f3947a721bb9",
      "duration": 3.938125
    },
    "s09-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s09-xiaobei-01-8a478c25e8bf1747.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "这次可以写：选择 A 加 C，最长用时七分钟。",
      "hash": "8a478c25e8bf17477a306d23bf1a432d66796e6ba4d97e983660d1e586413501",
      "duration": 3.9815
    },
    "s09-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s09-xiaobei-02-41b88183b1454e64.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "依据是哪次计算、哪些条件还没验证，也一起记下来。",
      "hash": "41b88183b1454e64ef99c9e8cc6779b7a8a8e61ef1c16ba021be0c06365ac28b",
      "duration": 4.203708
    },
    "s09-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s09-xiaobei-03-00e116944b653905.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "以后写论文，就能查到当时为什么这样选，嘿嘿，是不是很方便。",
      "hash": "00e116944b6539051754dd5fd8a826eab0c5b72d90be16407a7f832808756045",
      "duration": 4.945958
    },
    "s10-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s10-alpha-01-d47c35e98c008486.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "历史版本可以回看，修改前面的决定可能使后续成果需要重新确认。",
      "hash": "d47c35e98c00848655d3d02f9190862b31f46770f66e25c904bb6ed41a21c36d",
      "duration": 6.247417
    },
    "s10-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s10-alpha-02-e6421980198f458d.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "所有步骤确认后，才能整理成论文材料。",
      "hash": "e6421980198f458d4e9996ccaa0cde21d5a7f9c9633476d72b04718472915bec",
      "duration": 4.185583
    },
    "s10-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s10-xiaobei-01-f1f278224ccd45c1.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "假设变动后，相关计算要记得重新看一遍。",
      "hash": "f1f278224ccd45c123fd4f19c6607dc996415dcc0c9cf364f2d1835a2b93c7ed",
      "duration": 3.425917
    },
    "s10-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s10-xiaobei-02-a2883ac469d4288b.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "版本记录会把每次变化保留下来的 放心吧。",
      "hash": "a2883ac469d4288b80d4829fe8486d8c7f7fbaa4d7cfdeabb5ba70c8242ae54c",
      "duration": 3.9815
    },
    "s11-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s11-alpha-01-3a35f3d300edd76d.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里根据项目记录整理论文结构。",
      "hash": "3a35f3d300edd76d507c296e68ec8c4b10e04437926b1d1ab49817c4d7108879",
      "duration": 3.113417
    },
    "s11-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s11-alpha-02-4ce0fbb658613c09.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "每个章节都要对应实际完成的研究内容。",
      "hash": "4ce0fbb658613c095a6478267b811af5e2e3e8fa8b98906e7411d7f8ef94ce0b",
      "duration": 3.938125
    },
    "s11-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s11-xiaobei-01-ade58931b5c79643.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "刚才选 A 加 C 的理由，就应该出现在对应的章节里。",
      "hash": "ade58931b5c796431936f73b64169d526c8f91b4b011e8f5c920d88b9a7b21e7",
      "duration": 3.907417
    },
    "s11-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s11-xiaobei-02-ee780a83c3456dc4.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "当然，这里也能看到采用的研究材料，看看有没有遗漏需要解释的计算。",
      "hash": "ee780a83c3456dc4395c6f810e9638e9e8f53515146e8b102b7685b12f191938",
      "duration": 5.203708
    },
    "s12-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s12-alpha-01-1e7617822d04905f.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "局部内容使用“微调”，章节方向变化使用“重写本章”。",
      "hash": "1e7617822d04905f726c0a7747d878b19faa3a7c0cb88163642fc67f06ed919a",
      "duration": 4.927833
    },
    "s12-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s12-alpha-02-360acb303c04d977.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "公式、引用和版本记录都可以在这里核对。",
      "hash": "360acb303c04d97733a9363d59bf61b60f558a79d4f2ee2e38944c331529a091",
      "duration": 4.185583
    },
    "s12-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s12-xiaobei-01-c21bc14693febacf.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "比如想补上两个方案的对比，可以在微调里把要求写具体哦。",
      "hash": "c21bc14693febacff5660de09c063b22e0d32d665654ef0864c89a7c64e447ed",
      "duration": 4.611125
    },
    "s12-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s12-xiaobei-02-87998b70b2a4571d.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "改完觉得上一版更合适，也可以打开版本记录对照。",
      "hash": "87998b70b2a4571d4fa735fdd54129d0fb973ad90e59d0d0b316e01e34e93ee8",
      "duration": 3.75925
    },
    "s13-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s13-alpha-01-4f78226eb52c88a8.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "确认大纲后生成正文。",
      "hash": "4f78226eb52c88a8e66041951dc125db038f977db5884d3f42b541c1bc81fef9",
      "duration": 2.7835
    },
    "s13-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s13-alpha-02-b3e02b33fc3b31a6.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "页面会显示每章状态，未完成的章节可以继续处理。",
      "hash": "b3e02b33fc3b31a6f7c2edd93960b6350ba4fa758f04314b7a751df75f4c1b38",
      "duration": 4.927833
    },
    "s13-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s13-xiaobei-01-93bc56b115b84998.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "已经生成的章节可以打开读，等待其他章节时，随便检查一下内容吧。",
      "hash": "93bc56b115b849989efaa7127682b0c1be63ad6ef6b0871978ef035ce80b575f",
      "duration": 5.166667
    },
    "s14-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s14-alpha-01-ab390c32e789c840.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "通过目录检查正文和研究来源。",
      "hash": "ab390c32e789c8402e8de2c3e18baa3a7795219d431d085197b8ab6163d0552d",
      "duration": 3.361958
    },
    "s14-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s14-alpha-02-eaa32cbcb11ba822.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "确认图表、公式、结论一致后，可以导出 Word。",
      "hash": "eaa32cbcb11ba822c769b9e2743fa51662e5baa85ca9007f848d0f05a2fdc8e2",
      "duration": 5.092792
    },
    "s14-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s14-xiaobei-01-64e27bcf83e1cac3.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "现在能看到整篇论文了，我们看看选址结论写得怎么样。",
      "hash": "64e27bcf83e1cac39066719556b6a0adbecfa5d1b63559542899265ced2b1a26",
      "duration": 3.907417
    },
    "s14-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s14-xiaobei-02-b7034d0651130ec3.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "嗯嗯，表里写七分钟，正文里的数字也要一致，图表和公式都值得核对。",
      "hash": "b7034d0651130ec3d33d9594206cf08efb1614ed3e5d7117e9a9685cf959ad5d",
      "duration": 5.9815
    },
    "s14-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s14-xiaobei-03-6d6a3311c858a6dd.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "导出的文件还能在 Word 里继续编辑。",
      "hash": "6d6a3311c858a6dd2f3635b8e067e62d60de2f6df7c5b80a4c1e671c2253cd39",
      "duration": 2.796292
    },
    "s15-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s15-alpha-01-51c2f28e63842265.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "已有论文在这里集中管理。",
      "hash": "51c2f28e6384226594e0bbdbf04d18239f2923eadb5a95b9afe0bec71625088b",
      "duration": 2.701042
    },
    "s15-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s15-alpha-02-3d6d869e20bbeb01.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "按标题或状态查找文档，可以从上次的位置继续。",
      "hash": "3d6d869e20bbeb01d856a69a98b2509f3ced2f3b0b318fdcb05d1e517983ea8e",
      "duration": 4.3505
    },
    "s15-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s15-xiaobei-01-ecb8b659bd7141c4.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "忘了文档叫什么？没关系的，按状态筛选也能找，比如只看还在写的大纲。",
      "hash": "ecb8b659bd7141c40ad3709dcfa037bba9850fc304b5a793b8707af93c9939f7",
      "duration": 5.388875
    },
    "s15-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s15-xiaobei-02-d1a22123f4a60151.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "正文只生成了一部分的论文，也能从这里打开继续处理。",
      "hash": "d1a22123f4a60151e021206d45a4f9ad0e9a4dfee63283984500e32f4680d1d0",
      "duration": 4.092583
    },
    "s16-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s16-alpha-01-010388cb622bdeef.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "需要补充知识时，进入学习页面。",
      "hash": "010388cb622bdeef03d152080432afb2dde95caf1eef2e79c6094e788dc1bbf2",
      "duration": 3.361958
    },
    "s16-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s16-alpha-02-c69ae825720d924b.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "可以按学习路径阅读，也可以按模块和难度查找。",
      "hash": "c69ae825720d924ba45a7174d9ba82dd3e8f6565038bcc28fdfbcc51617c9256",
      "duration": 4.597958
    },
    "s16-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s16-xiaobei-01-5ba6590792f5c878.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "做题时遇到线性规划这样的陌生方法，可以直接搜名称。",
      "hash": "5ba6590792f5c878859878cba867537e9bdc35a32623d5ef905339f88f92c434",
      "duration": 4.462958
    },
    "s16-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s16-xiaobei-02-915da1d53c4bd722.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "想从基础学起，就打开学习路径，看看我给你推荐的内容。",
      "hash": "915da1d53c4bd72270f7acabf7a2defdaa8239934f840e3783fc2b65df904a03",
      "duration": 4.685167
    },
    "s17-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s17-alpha-01-c188aea450746f0e.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "阅读器会展示解释、例子、公式和应用。",
      "hash": "c188aea450746f0e6330d230de544efd4db40e7798fea6ed4e80510fbb7ecccc",
      "duration": 4.268042
    },
    "s17-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s17-alpha-02-d78547332dbf29ea.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "理解之后可以标记掌握，也可以围绕当前知识点提问。",
      "hash": "d78547332dbf29ea32923a0bed7b6907bb4a0b03e4afe5926ee8043df16dba8d",
      "duration": 5.340208
    },
    "s17-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s17-xiaobei-01-5167fc2e249df93c.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "公式里的符号不熟悉时，结合例子看会容易理解一些。",
      "hash": "5167fc2e249df93c48cb8fd25d55c55fc74b7296567f2107d6074ddbf6ed8bff",
      "duration": 4.277792
    },
    "s17-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s17-xiaobei-02-26e79242430ba22b.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "还有疑问的话，就带着当前知识点提问吧。",
      "hash": "26e79242430ba22b17f8de63a832657a37ee2c6787ada302322a204946e842ce",
      "duration": 3.166667
    },
    "s18-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s18-alpha-01-83e3bce526775709.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "测评用于了解当前水平，也可以自行选择等级。",
      "hash": "83e3bce526775709cfcf2da476786a7a740ad3a0bc424588ba3081db5231187f",
      "duration": 5.17525
    },
    "s18-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s18-alpha-02-8a125674b4aee1c5.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "答题时可以返回上一题检查和修改。",
      "hash": "8a125674b4aee1c5ee4691e55b755ba054a73a38b354d3d3ec3078f38c4ed3ca",
      "duration": 3.443292
    },
    "s18-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s18-xiaobei-01-1f435afdefb029c1.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "答题时发现前一道理解错了，可以返回修改。",
      "hash": "1f435afdefb029c16622c40f4cd253f28deda5cf7aaf3722a60a3c94f383e108",
      "duration": 3.649958
    },
    "s19-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s19-alpha-01-830f44a460b05624.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "结果页会列出薄弱模块和推荐学习路径。",
      "hash": "830f44a460b0562437c1d4322d6f39fc9eb6733a7a10659529ab7e925b78d10f",
      "duration": 4.681958
    },
    "s19-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s19-alpha-02-76afc2d768922816.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里可以查看答案解析，也能重新测评。",
      "hash": "76afc2d76892281600bd713471a912021baf2c7c73990ae388cb3664f4ef4e5c",
      "duration": 3.773208
    },
    "s19-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s19-xiaobei-01-c882d9f79af37803.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "我会建议你看看错题解析：是概念没理解，还是计算时出错了？",
      "hash": "c882d9f79af3780399f0f1543577a2af734ff4d9f3cbe344e3479681580b4725",
      "duration": 4.425917
    },
    "s19-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s19-xiaobei-02-14f2fb4a62184425.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "推荐路径可以接着打开，补完相关内容后也能重新测一次。",
      "hash": "14f2fb4a621844255b7c9185d8494cf2b506aa5f8c18c86744d6dfa6c7d60bca",
      "duration": 4.611125
    },
    "s20-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s20-alpha-01-62be55e08d124b8a.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里提供完整赛题的分步练习。",
      "hash": "62be55e08d124b8a5c4167071120d6048d66b41faca0072bf21db5f135048920",
      "duration": 3.690708
    },
    "s20-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s20-alpha-02-416cf2ef6bf82127.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "可以按题名、年份和难度查找，已开始的题目可以继续。",
      "hash": "416cf2ef6bf8212772d82b265c1d2686a7e4903e8fe10572a0acc234344bce29",
      "duration": 5.835042
    },
    "s20-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s20-xiaobei-01-7ff1cf963a2575f8.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "想做真题的话，就在这里选。",
      "hash": "7ff1cf963a2575f8a12b74905b227fbb99209860189e2b9ab6c692cefa7b9511",
      "duration": 2.314833
    },
    "s20-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s20-xiaobei-02-ec3b681513fc0ad1.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "找到感兴趣的题目，可以看一下难度和要求。",
      "hash": "ec3b681513fc0ad14437a6d43a9d9213288023a0e937526fa04eb05b2fb76c18",
      "duration": 3.314833
    },
    "s20-xiaobei-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s20-xiaobei-03-d4b9a2804531c0a7.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "练习按步骤进行，每次处理当前任务，放心吧，不用一次写完整篇论文 是不是很贴心。",
      "hash": "d4b9a2804531c0a7c44a3cbf431ace20562d0be293f1845a8ff287c69c08f288",
      "duration": 6.796292
    },
    "s21-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s21-alpha-01-3da2545145998cb6.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "目录列出这道题的练习步骤。",
      "hash": "3da2545145998cb61f03c4bc1e16905d3a1e5d4bfbd4d2bd8fa951de45748059",
      "duration": 2.701042
    },
    "s21-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s21-alpha-02-9708dec2f70297e8.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "每一步都有提示和讨论区，也能使用公式与代码工具。",
      "hash": "9708dec2f70297e8acd3d6a776abc18bc081cf888a099813cc57aea0d85643b0",
      "duration": 5.092792
    },
    "s21-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s21-alpha-03-5d0cbf2ec50d5966.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "完成当前任务后，点击评估查看反馈。",
      "hash": "5d0cbf2ec50d59665546a66888c7bdbd239f561086cc9f11a9fa222b9b81721e",
      "duration": 4.433
    },
    "s21-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s21-xiaobei-01-effc702224609f05.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "不知道怎么写时，看看当前提示，或者在讨论区说说你已经想到什么。",
      "hash": "effc702224609f055705a97df1868cc31666f9ec6acdd5e32245bcceae39cd92",
      "duration": 5.351833
    },
    "s21-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s21-xiaobei-02-4384c8b1865284cc.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "评估里提到哪些条件没考虑，就回到当前步骤补充，自己的理由也可以继续讨论。",
      "hash": "4384c8b1865284cc14c275d5fde02c395fe925083bbddfd7c6f32a1c22707206",
      "duration": 5.907417
    },
    "s22-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s22-alpha-01-9e8b83c098763358.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "独立计算和探索从工具入口进入。",
      "hash": "9e8b83c0987633587ab1ec2740450a8aaf0defdb371504b49d81b70bf24a0283",
      "duration": 3.855667
    },
    "s22-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s22-alpha-02-cd4185aa0a275be3.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "自由工作台适合文件、对话和代码一起使用，独立编辑器专注代码运行。",
      "hash": "cd4185aa0a275be3b9d7bc79344c25ec36810aa1591a47377c93ced1ddbb1228",
      "duration": 7.237125
    },
    "s22-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s22-xiaobei-01-166220031a41849e.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "比如手上只有一份数据，想试试怎么画图，就能从这里开始。",
      "hash": "166220031a41849e801355a2f4f5620f70fd6c98de5cfc2ad83e1fa3441e8dab",
      "duration": 4.537958
    },
    "s22-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s22-xiaobei-02-ef90a1e0f454305f.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "需要助教一起看代码，选自由工作台；自己编程就打开独立编辑器。",
      "hash": "ef90a1e0f454305f6c27f14259bf04e239e2c1722f6a50227c556cde9f01b05e",
      "duration": 5.351833
    },
    "s23-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s23-alpha-01-608f2e5945a0b13c.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "自由工作台把文件、代码和对话放在同一页面。",
      "hash": "608f2e5945a0b13ca4535c218ee5c08f36a3d977b6a7371ab8a19e84d31cf525",
      "duration": 5.257958
    },
    "s23-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s23-alpha-02-b9dd305f63436b5c.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "选中的代码可以发送给助教，返回的代码也能放回编辑器。",
      "hash": "b9dd305f63436b5c95acfa568f49023928cc102a364aaec0d0cb55e15295d422",
      "duration": 5.340208
    },
    "s23-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s23-alpha-03-77b5a536a01a0a36.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "使用前确认工作目录。",
      "hash": "77b5a536a01a0a36bd1ead0cc43eff3e7d069b5816c1142afe6f2b72a751c7ea",
      "duration": 2.536083
    },
    "s23-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s23-xiaobei-01-5165fb0ae3c77c5b.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "现在展示的是示例文件，不会读写你的文件夹；正式使用时，记得选到自己的项目目录。",
      "hash": "5165fb0ae3c77c5b11a38b6d5bb4958cf94cd27e74006c25f75770de7db6c56f",
      "duration": 6.537042
    },
    "s24-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s24-alpha-01-aaf5df10b8d9aeb1.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "这里可以独立编辑和运行代码。",
      "hash": "aaf5df10b8d9aeb18e6a38f7f87d86274e9127f1a705b4e7e218008ca0964744",
      "duration": 2.948458
    },
    "s24-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s24-alpha-02-c52245a643d8e507.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "保存前确认目录，程序需要输入时，在终端完成输入。",
      "hash": "c52245a643d8e5075f74e04420570a64bb5823d4454bb9f1f484a7485862d290",
      "duration": 6.329917
    },
    "s24-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s24-alpha-03-1f6168f84f8e2d69.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "代码会在你的电脑上执行。",
      "hash": "1f6168f84f8e2d69bd9020992645383b9bc985741f8c060ab96ab488428df78f",
      "duration": 2.618542
    },
    "s24-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s24-xiaobei-01-ee59f74fd6fa4fa8.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "比如程序要你输入一个数字，就在下面的终端填写。",
      "hash": "ee59f74fd6fa4fa8271d52ba5f0637a4533f1f3e03f4cc4861c1bfdc5433d29d",
      "duration": 3.796292
    },
    "s24-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s24-xiaobei-02-f66804fa3140fd5d.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "发现参数填错了，可以点停止，改好代码后重新运行。",
      "hash": "f66804fa3140fd5dfe4f6edb61ff05e1cb0fb9c28d55563fcb527a896592d080",
      "duration": 4.796292
    },
    "s25-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s25-alpha-01-cf2e5b0b558f9cd3.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "使用智能功能前，需要连接模型。",
      "hash": "cf2e5b0b558f9cd3b2b9fd325e627a83db8cec2c20561de760a8d3e2df6a602d",
      "duration": 3.195875
    },
    "s25-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s25-alpha-02-8afea977380a26d5.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "可以使用提供的服务，或配置自己的接口。",
      "hash": "8afea977380a26d5d62382bbdebf4faa081a2109f9b3c182c8686b7cd6e0d364",
      "duration": 3.855667
    },
    "s25-alpha-03": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s25-alpha-03-8b5624b0ff8244f6.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "分工偏好用于调整回答侧重。",
      "hash": "8b5624b0ff8244f67557cef6aef7932cbe2e64aadbc10efe47a87c4fd12a8cd3",
      "duration": 2.948458
    },
    "s26-alpha-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s26-alpha-01-68ba54afa3a74f2a.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "导览到这里结束。",
      "hash": "68ba54afa3a74f2a6f33462918d9e5b95de83a4eda15afd1d0050edd457ec34d",
      "duration": 2.041958
    },
    "s26-alpha-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s26-alpha-02-c8a96291ee7849c7.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "现在可以打开任意模块开始操作。",
      "hash": "c8a96291ee7849c75b0438b8aa82024e2416f57489868c02e4bf5d0957c423de",
      "duration": 3.278333
    },
    "s26-xiaobei-01": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s26-xiaobei-01-af93ebe25498c79a.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "接下来想试哪一部分，就打开对应的页面吧。",
      "hash": "af93ebe25498c79a58ef8f21bf4d0e38db68dfb5ead646df827154da865b4a70",
      "duration": 3.166667
    },
    "s26-xiaobei-02": {
      "file": "guide-voice-s26-xiaobei-02-6b78bd13ab10eb5c.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "需要我们重新说明时，在“更多”里找“使用引导”，没看完的部分也能继续。",
      "hash": "6b78bd13ab10eb5c7ba8c704107f06710b84b618ffd3e88272208a575dd9d68f",
      "duration": 5.462958
    },
    "transition-home-alpha": {
      "file": "guide-voice-transition-home-alpha-73a2105c89583969.mp3",
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "text": "本部分到这里。下面介绍认识主页。",
      "hash": "73a2105c89583969f56dbf37dc9b1a74bf22d6d134d7c2e516f727282296526d",
      "duration": 9.134
    },
    "transition-home-xiaobei-1": {
      "file": "guide-voice-transition-home-xiaobei-1-6feb53f06ef741e3.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "要继续吗？也可以暂停导览，自己操作。",
      "hash": "6feb53f06ef741e3b2c7065a3d9ffe481aec650caf75ef737ac0844bf00f1c77",
      "duration": 3.277792
    },
    "transition-home-xiaobei-2": {
      "file": "guide-voice-transition-home-xiaobei-2-dee70b7757257949.mp3",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "text": "暂停后会保存位置，下次打开对应模块还能继续。",
      "hash": "dee70b7757257949e061ac7df50f3d715427014dbf3fab48e1b392bf7b23dac5",
      "duration": 3.9815
    },
